{"availability":"available","full":"CopilotKit/OpenBot","name":"OpenBot","description":"Open-source AI coworkers that each get a computer of their own: a browser, files and tools, with every action decided before it happens and recorded after. Bring any AG-UI agent.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":6322,"forks":863,"created":"2026-08-17T00:44:59Z","updated":"2026-10-09T23:02:39Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.copilotkit.ai/openbot","topics":["ag-ui","agent-governance","ai-agents","browser-automation","copilotkit","generative-ui","mcp"],"demo":"https://httpbin.org/forms/post","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:13.323Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:13.323Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:13.323Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:14.142Z","stars":5930,"forks":788},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:12:21.479Z","stars":6020,"forks":806},{"at":"2026-10-06T17:12:13.041Z","stars":6113,"forks":819},{"at":"2026-10-08T21:26:58.294Z","stars":6221,"forks":846},{"at":"2026-10-11T09:01:13.323Z","stars":6322,"forks":863}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The AI assistant your company can actually own. Same shape as ChatGPT, Claude or Grok, with one difference that matters: it runs on your infrastructure and you can change anything about it. Any agent stack, through AG-UI.","Each coworker gets a computer of its own: a real browser with its own logins, its own files, and only the tools you grant. Every action decided before it happens and recorded after.","Talk to an engineer · Have us build it with you · copilotkit.ai/openbot · Quick start · Docs"],"features":["A computer per Bot: the supervisor gives each Bot its own container, its own /workspace volume and its own browser profile. Set COMPUTERRUNTIME=runsc to run them under gVisor where the host supports it.","A shell, not just a browser: a Bot can run a command in its workspace, install what it needs, and process a file it saved. Through the same gate as everything else, so a rule can refuse a shell outright or refuse…","The gateway is the only way in: it resolves the target from a server-held snapshot, evaluates the policy, writes the audit row, and only then calls the computer. There is no path that acts without the record existing…","CEL policy, fail closed: rules can inspect tool.name, intent, bot.id, actor.id, page.url, page.host, element., key, command, file., mcp. and initiator. (what started the run, so a rule can refuse a scheduled routine…","Watch what it is doing: the screen shows what a Bot is looking at, and the Activity tab beside it shows what it ran, read and saved, with the output. A command line in the transcript opens to the same thing. A saved…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CopilotKit/OpenBot/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"53e7f348f2068733a159f5cab288c69126f65b675d8842f8b733fec510ab62b1","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:13.394Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:13.394Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T23:02:39Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:13.323Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T17:50:45.959Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v0.1.0","tag":"v0.1.0","publishedAt":"2026-10-03T00:45:44Z","url":"https://github.com/CopilotKit/OpenBot/releases/tag/v0.1.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T17:50:45.959Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/bb752c44e706ef88fc7cf860.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-11T09:12:51.838Z","url":"https://httpbin.org/forms/post"}],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://httpbin.org/forms/post","attemptedAt":"2026-10-11T09:12:51.838Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:12:51.838Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-11T09:12:51.838Z","target":"https://httpbin.org/forms/post","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-18T09:12:51.838Z","probeVersion":3,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The AI assistant your company can actually own. Same shape as ChatGPT, Claude or Grok,